  {
   "say": "The biggest study ever measured more than fifteen thousand men.",
   "cap": "THE BIGGEST STUDY EVER | MEASURED OVER | *15,000 MEN.*",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "say": "Measured by doctors, not by guesses.",
   "cap": "MEASURED BY *DOCTORS,* | NOT BY GUESSES.",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "say": "The real average?",
   "cap": "THE *REAL* AVERAGE?",
   "pause": 0.2
  },
  {
   "say": "Thirteen point one centimetres. About five point two inches.",
   "cap": "*13.1 CM.* | ABOUT *5.2 INCHES.*",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "say": "Not six. And definitely not what the internet shows you.",
   "cap": "NOT SIX. | AND DEFINITELY *NOT* | WHAT THE *INTERNET* | SHOWS YOU.",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "say": "Now the twist.",
   "cap": "NOW THE *TWIST.*",
   "pause": 0.2
  },
  {
   "say": "Lots of men who are totally average think they're below average.",
   "cap": "LOTS OF MEN WHO ARE | *TOTALLY AVERAGE* | THINK THEY'RE | *BELOW AVERAGE.*",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "say": "Doctors even have a name for it.",
   "cap": "DOCTORS EVEN | HAVE A *NAME* FOR IT.",
   "pause": 0.2
  },
  {
   "say": "Small penis anxiety.",
   "cap": "*SMALL PENIS ANXIETY.*",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "say": "So, does size matter?",
   "cap": "SO, DOES | *SIZE MATTER?*",
   "pause": 0.2
  },
  {
   "say": "Here's what matters. Most guys who worry are completely normal.",
   "cap": "MOST GUYS | WHO WORRY ARE | *COMPLETELY NORMAL.*",
   "pause": 0.2
  },
  {
